WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.126
- I have one bone to pick with you.

00:00:02.126 --> 00:00:02.959
- Okay.

00:00:02.959 --> 00:00:05.410
- So like with "Saved By The Bell" reboot,

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:07.803
I know that somebody had
to sing the theme song.

00:00:07.803 --> 00:00:10.150
- Yes.
- Yeah, who was that?

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:10.983
- You know what?

00:00:10.983 --> 00:00:12.820
We actually had Lil Yachty. (laughs)

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:14.950
- Okay, fine, that's fine.

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:16.370
- Can I tell you something, Kelly, though?

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:17.530
- [Kelly] I would have totally done it.

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:18.363
- First though, okay.

00:00:18.363 --> 00:00:19.560
- I just sang the whole thing

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:20.794
before you came out here with Jesse.

00:00:20.794 --> 00:00:22.300
- I was hearing you backstage.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:23.210
- Okay.
- You know I love you,

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:24.273
you know you're my favorite.

00:00:24.273 --> 00:00:25.530
- [Kelly] I'm just saying,
it would have me amazing.

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:26.703
- I know you would have killed it.

00:00:26.703 --> 00:00:27.536
- Lil Yachty was probably amazing.

00:00:27.536 --> 00:00:29.260
- I always tell everyone
because you know...

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:30.240
First of all, thank you so much

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:31.800
for filling in for me on my radio show,

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:32.633
when we did the countdown.

00:00:32.633 --> 00:00:34.420
Everyone over at On With Mario loves you.

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:36.730
You know we're big, big
fans, but I always say,

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:38.470
I feel sorry for the other artists

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:39.410
when you do the KellyOkies,

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:41.128
'cause you do their songs so much.

00:00:41.128 --> 00:00:41.961
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:41.961 --> 00:00:43.260
I'm not lying, you usually
take it next level,

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:44.093
and it's so much better, I go,

00:00:44.093 --> 00:00:45.210
oh my God, I would buy that one.

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:46.380
- Sometimes it doesn't work.

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:47.890
My favorite thing that
anyone's ever said to me,

00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:49.717
Garth Brooks was on the show and he goes,

00:00:49.717 --> 00:00:52.080
"Is there any genre you wouldn't go near?"

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:53.950
And I was like, there are genres

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:56.295
I shouldn't go near, but I do it.

00:00:56.295 --> 00:00:58.140
- No, no, you're killing 'em all.

00:00:58.140 --> 00:00:59.350
- I love music.
- I know.

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:00.320
- [Kelly] So that's what's
cool about your job too,

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:01.510
you get to like celebrate all music.

00:01:01.510 --> 00:01:02.660
- Yes, I love music too.

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:03.960
I love music, I love entertainment.

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:05.010
That's why I love doing
Access Hollywood and all that.

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:05.843
- How has it been?

00:01:05.843 --> 00:01:06.676
'Cause COVID's weird.

00:01:06.676 --> 00:01:07.720
So how's it been doing the radio show,

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:08.590
Access Hollywood, all of it?

00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:09.980
- You know what?

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:11.178
We really haven't stopped, to be honest.

00:01:11.178 --> 00:01:13.090
We did it a little bit at home.

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:15.587
I was shooting out in my backyard
with Access Hollywood and-

00:01:15.587 --> 00:01:18.010
- I had to do it out of my
backyard for a while too.

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:18.843
- Yeah, for a little while.

00:01:18.843 --> 00:01:20.630
But then we were the
first show, I believe,

00:01:20.630 --> 00:01:22.040
on the lot back with access,

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:23.230
which is great, which is nice

00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:24.920
because we're celebrating
our 25 year anniversary.

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:27.320
And we're really excited
over there about that.

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.130
And then On With Mario, with the show,

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:30.480
we do it on the lot as well.

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:31.940
So everything's sorta
consolidated right here.

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:33.350
So we kinda kept on going.

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:35.323
Between that, and then I
did my Christmas movie,

00:01:35.323 --> 00:01:38.010
"Feliz NaviDAD" over in Nevada.

00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:39.630
So I've been keeping really busy.

00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:40.463
- [Kelly] Nevada's beautiful.

00:01:40.463 --> 00:01:41.540
- And the new "Saved By The Bell" so yeah.

00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:43.740
- That's amazing, I love Christmas.

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:45.100
I will watch any Christmas movie.

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:46.350
I love Christmas so much.

